<title>SOUTH AFRICA: RUGBY UNION-TRANSVAAL BEAT OTAGO 47-29.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-TRANSVAAL BEAT OTAGO 47-29.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transvaal beat Otago 47-29</p>
<p>(half time 30-10) in the Super 12 match at Ellis Park on Friday</p>
<p>night.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Transvaal: Tries - Kobus Wiese, Gavin Johnson (2), Andre</p>
<p>Vos, Jannie van der Walt, Conversions - Johnson (5), Penalties -</p>
<p>Johnson (4).</p>
<p>Otago: Tries - Manasa Bari, Romi Ropati, Jeff Wilson, Taine</p>
<p>Randell, Conversions - Tony Brown (3), Penalty - Brown.</p>
</text>
